  - id: vapor_under_the_sun
    displayName: Vapor Under the Sun
    flavorText: Declares 'vanity of vanities, all is vanity,' opening the book's
      inquiry into what lasting profit, if any, exists in a man's labour under the
      sun.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: States the book's governing thesis that every human pursuit, achievement,
      and possession 'under the sun' is fleeting vapor when weighed against eternity,
      framing everything that follows as an inquiry into lasting profit.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: vanity_of_vanities
