  - id: lamp_of_wisdom
    displayName: Lamp of Wisdom
    flavorText: Weighs wisdom against folly, finding wisdom excels 'as far as light
      excelleth darkness,' yet unable to outrun death or guarantee remembrance.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Weighs the value of human wisdom against folly and finds wisdom genuinely
      superior, yet ultimately unable to outrun death or guarantee remembrance, so
      wisdom profits within life but cannot secure lasting advantage beyond it.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: wisdom_and_folly
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
