  - id: seasons_wheel
    displayName: Season's Wheel
    flavorText: Recites fourteen paired opposites - a time to be born and to die,
      to plant and to pluck up - declaring God has appointed a fitting season for
      every purpose.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A poetic catalogue of paired opposites asserting that God has appointed
      a fitting season for every human activity, and that discerning God's timing,
      not human control, governs a well-lived life.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: time_for_every_purpose
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
