  - id: tears_of_the_oppressed
    displayName: Tears of the Oppressed
    flavorText: Beholds the tears of the oppressed who have no comforter, and finds
      wickedness even in the very place of judgment.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: Surveys the corruption of human courts and social power - wickedness
      in the seat of judgment, oppressors whose victims have no comforter, and the
      leveling truth that death erases any distinction wealth or power once bought.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: injustice_under_the_sun
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
