  - id: bread_and_wine
    displayName: Bread and Wine
    flavorText: Counsels that there is nothing better for a man than to eat and drink
      and find enjoyment in his labour, for this is the gift of God.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: 'The book''s recurring positive counter-refrain to its vanity thesis:
      since ultimate gain cannot be secured or fully understood, God''s gift to mortal
      life is the simple, immediate enjoyment of food, drink, and the fruit of one''s
      own labour.'
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: eat_drink_and_enjoy_labour
