  - id: the_threefold_cord
    displayName: The Threefold Cord
    flavorText: Declares two are better than one, for if they fall the one will lift
      up his fellow, and a threefold cord is not quickly broken.
    tierType: 1
    purpose: A short wisdom poem on companionship arguing that mutual human relationship
      - lifting one another up, sharing warmth, defending one another - is a genuine,
      tangible good within an otherwise vanity-filled life.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: two_are_better_than_one
    icon: {fileID: 0}
    managerIcon: {fileID: 0}
