  - id: the_whole_duty
    displayName: The Whole Duty
    flavorText: 'Concludes the whole matter: fear God and keep his commandments,
      for this is the whole duty of man, since God will bring every work into judgment.'
    tierType: 1
    purpose: The book's closing summation - after every earthly pursuit has been
      tested and found to be vapor, the one enduring counsel offered is to fear God
      and keep his commandments, because God will ultimately judge every deed.
    deliveredByManagerId: the_preacher
    managerId: fear_god_keep_commandments
